Create a new metric

Usage: vendo metrics create [OPTIONS] --name <name> --definition <file>

Options:
      --name <name>         Metric name
      --definition <file>   QuerySpec v2 definition JSON file
      --description <desc>  Description
      --format <format>     Display format: number, currency, percentage, multiplier [default: number]
      --unit <unit>         Unit suffix (e.g., "$", "%")
      --json                Output raw JSON
  -h, --help                Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile (or set VENDO_PROFILE)
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics

Examples:
  $ vendo metrics create --name "ROAS" --definition roas.query.json
  $ vendo metrics create --name "Total Revenue" --definition revenue.query.json --format currency
  $ vendo metrics create --name "CTR" --definition ctr.query.json --format percentage
